    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical and useful, especially in everyday life like budgeting or understanding statistics in news. I didn’t study it deeply in school, but I’ve used it in my work and hobbies—like calculating distances while cycling or tracking expenses. It’s not my favorite subject, but I see its value in making sense of the world.",
