    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a simple AI app last year to help me understand basic algebra and budgeting. It walked me through examples step by step, which made complex ideas easier to grasp. I found it helpful for quick checks and explanations, especially when I was learning on my own. It didn’t replace my thinking, but it supported my learning in a friendly, patient way.",
